Lit (playground of the capture service)
----------------------------------------
sidecar/package.json depends on lit 3.3.3 (https://lit.dev), which the capture service uses to bundle a
project's exported Lit library into the playground page. npm installs it, with its dependencies, into
sidecar/node_modules (npm --prefix sidecar ci); it is not copied into this repository, and the exported
library of a project is generated code that depends on lit itself. These packages are published by
Google LLC under the BSD 3-Clause licence, whose text follows:

